            "sid": "ZEC 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wupenj koth ba Yehova i nindo mi koth ma cen, cil ba. Yehova m’utimo lukoth; man ebimio igi cori mi koth, ku ba dhanu nzu ng’atu man lum ma numu i podho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.9.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 9:36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.6.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk 6:34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum ayi gin m’acwia giyero lembe ma ie nanu, man jung’eilembe gineno ndra; man giyero lek mi ndra, gijuko juk mananu: ka kumeno gicidho i yo migi calu rombe, jusendogi, kum jakwac umbe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng’ecwiny para bogre kum jukwac, man abimio masendi ba nyogi diegi; kum Yehova mir udul uliewo udul rombe pare, en e ot mi Yuda, man ebikethogi calu riuni pare ma ber i lwiny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kidi ma wi gui biai i bang’e, musumali biai i bang’e, atum mir ali biai i bang’e, jubim kubang’gi nzu karacelo biai i bang’e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man gibibedo calu dhanu ma tek, ma gibenyono jukwojgi i unzabu mi gengi i lwiny; man gibikiedo, kum Yehova ni karacelo kugi; man cwiny ju m’uwotho ku wi riuni bing’abre. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E abimio tego ni ot mi Yuda, man abibodho ot pa Yusuf, e abidwokogi; kum kisa nega i kumgi; man gibibedo calu abayugi ngo: kum an a Yehova Mungu migi, man abiwinjogi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Efraim bibedo calu jakero man anyong’a binego adundegi calu ku pigulok; eyo, nyithindho migi bineno maeni, man anyong’a binegogi; anyong’a binego adundegi ni kum Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abilwong’ogi ku lwio, e abicokogi; kum awarugi; man gibimedri calu gimedri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E abicoyogi i kind kodhidhanu; njan gibipoi pira i ng’om ma bor; man gibibedo ku nyithindhgi, e gibidwogo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abikelogi kendo bende kud i ng’om Misiri, man abicokogi kud i Ascur; e abikelogi i ng’om Gilead man Lebanon; man kaka binwangre igi ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ebikadhu kud i nam mi masendi, man ebigoyo mukura mi nam, e kut ceke mi Nil bidwono; man kuhaya mir Ascur bijwik piny, man uluth mi ker mi Misiri biai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E abimio tego igi i Yehova; man gibiwotho malu ku piny i nyinge, Yehova wacu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
